// ==============================================================================
// 🌹 Roze Raylib Game Engine Standard Library Module (ADV-04)
// ==============================================================================
// High-performance 2D/3D Game Platform bindings via Roze C-FFI.
// Features:
// - 60 FPS Real-Time Windowing & GPU Render Loop
// - 2D Vector Primitives, Shapes & Sprite Rendering
// - 3D Perspective Camera, Grids & 3D Geometry
// - Procedural Audio Waveform Synthesis (Laser, Explosion, Chime)
// - Keyboard, Mouse & Gamepad Input Handling
// - Particle System & Physics Collision Detection
// ==============================================================================

// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// 1. C-FFI Native Raylib Bridge Declarations
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

